   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"9\">\n    <li>A backyard farmer wants to enclose a rectangular space for a new garden within her fenced backyard. She has purchased 80 feet of wire fencing to enclose three sides, and she will use a section of the backyard fence as the fourth side. The function is graphed below. What is the maximum area, in square feet, that can be fenced in?</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img alt=\"image\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"293\" src=\"exercises/media/330884e37fc3329b.jpg\" width=\"310\"></p>",
